    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Key Features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Easy SMTP Configuration: Set up your preferred SMTP provider in minutes</li>\n<li>Detailed Email Logging: Track all outgoing emails with comprehensive logs</li>\n<li>Email Status Tracking: Monitor delivery status, opens, and clicks</li>\n<li>Multiple SMTP Providers: Support for popular email services</li>\n<li>Email Queue Management: Schedule and prioritize email sending</li>\n<li>Debug Mode: Troubleshoot email delivery issues effectively</li>\n<li>Responsive Support: Get help when you need it</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Source code link : https://github.com/nur-alam/trigger</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Trigger is a powerful WordPress SMTP configuration plugin that simplifies your site&#039;s email delivery system with detailed email logging.",
    "description": "<p>Key Features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Easy SMTP Configuration: Set up your preferred SMTP provider in minutes</li>\n<li>Detailed Email Logging: Track all outgoing emails with comprehensive logs</li>\n<li>Email Status Tracking: Monitor delivery status, opens, and clicks</li>\n<li>Multiple SMTP Providers: Support for popular email services</li>\n<li>Email Queue Management: Schedule and prioritize email sending</li>\n<li>Debug Mode: Troubleshoot email delivery issues effectively</li>\n<li>Responsive Support: Get help when you need it</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Source code link : https://github.com/nur-alam/trigger</p>\n",
